      "grimpoteuthidae": "Grimpoteuthidae",
      "growing_toward_sexual_maturity_stable_": "Growing toward sexual maturity. Stable home range + 1-3 dens. Selects highest-quality crab + clam prey. Camouflage repertoire is fully developed. Some species (like Octopus tetricus in Australia) start to show social interactions during this phase — multiple individuals occupying the same complex of dens (\"octopolis\").",
