      "digestion_is_mechanical_chewing_churni": "Digestion is mechanical (chewing, churning, peristalsis) AND chemical (enzymes breaking molecules apart). Different parts of the journey handle different macronutrients. Hormones coordinate the whole process — from \"I'm hungry\" to \"I'm full\" — across hours and days.",
