      "bm_in_plain_words": "In plain words",
      "bm_intro_copy": "Pick a nutrient and the body regions that use it glow, while a stream traces the route from your gut. Click an organ in the figure (or in the list) to see everything it depends on. Drag to turn the figure, or use the buttons and arrow keys. Nothing here is a target or a score: this is a map of what your body does with food.",
