      "in_1500_literacy_was_rare_so_reading_a": "In 1500 literacy was rare, so reading aloud was normal. One copy in a tavern might reach 10–20 hearers per evening.",
      "in_1966_pope_paul_vi_formally_abolishe": "In 1966 Pope Paul VI formally abolished the Index. The Vatican stated that Catholics still had a moral obligation to avoid harmful reading, but the formal apparatus was gone. Today the Index is studied as a primary source — a 407-year map of what authorities most feared.",
