      "reading_mirror_reversed_type_by_candle": "Reading mirror-reversed type by candle or oil-lamp light, for 10+ hour days, ruined eyes. Reading glasses became common among compositors a century before they were common in the general population.",
      "reading_old_papers": "Reading old papers",
      "real_history_luther_s_95_theses_oct_15": "Real history: Luther’s 95 Theses (Oct 1517) reached Rome by Dec 1517. Distance ~750 miles. The mechanism was exactly this multiplier — print + read-aloud + reprint, in dozens of cities, all in three months. No army or institution could keep up with the spread.",
