      "tsien_tsuen_hsuin_paper_and_printing_i_2": "Tsien Tsuen-Hsuin, \"Paper and Printing\" in Joseph Needham, Science and Civilisation in China vol. 5 part 1 (1985)",
      "tunes_the_drying_rate_and_consistency_": "Tunes the drying rate and consistency for the season. Hot summer ink is mixed differently from cold winter ink. This is artisan judgment, not a fixed formula.",
