      "type_a_water_safety_question_the_ai_gr": "Type a water safety question. The AI grounds its answer in CDC, USCG, AAP, NOAA, NAA, ASAN, and other primary sources cited throughout this lab. ",
      "us_coast_guard_life_jacket_wear_inform": "US Coast Guard — Life Jacket Wear Information",
      "us_coast_guard_recreational_boating_sa": "US Coast Guard — Recreational Boating Safety",
