      "higher_amps_deeper_penetration_more_he": "Higher amps = deeper penetration, more heat",
      "higher_heat_input_per_inch": "• Higher heat input per inch",
      "higher_mn_si_than_s_3_better_for_light": "Higher Mn + Si than S-3. Better for: light mill scale on steel. Slightly stronger weld.",
      "highest_mn_si_content_best_for_rusty_d": "Highest Mn + Si content. Best for: rusty/dirty/galvanized steel, autobody work. The #1-selling MIG wire because it tolerates real-world conditions.",
      "highest_pay_even_if_i_travel": "💰 Highest pay even if I travel",
