      "hinckley_yachts_trenton_southwest_harb": "Hinckley Yachts (Trenton + Southwest Harbor)",
      "hodgdon_mid_coast_boat_builders_family": "Hodgdon, mid-coast boat builders, family fab shops",
      "hodgdon_yachts_east_boothbay": "Hodgdon Yachts (East Boothbay)",
      "hodgdon_yachts_east_boothbay_lyman_mor": "Hodgdon Yachts (East Boothbay), Lyman-Morse (Thomaston), Sabre (Raymond), Front Street Shipyard (Belfast). Aluminum + stainless TIG primarily. Smaller crews, more variety.",
      "hold_your_breath_while_welding_the_bea": "Hold your breath while welding the bead.",
      "hole_punched_through": "hole punched through",
      "hollow_structural_sections_hss": "Hollow structural sections (HSS).",
      "hood_gloves_jacket_boots_respirator_wh": "Hood, gloves, jacket, boots, respirator (when needed). Skip one and you do not weld today. Arc burns retinas in seconds.",
      "horizontal_bead_runs_sideways": "Horizontal — bead runs sideways",
